Dear Facundo,

Many thanks for the reply. It makes sense now and I understood how to use a marker based matrix in breedR now.

It's a pity that breedR can't handle categorical responses but we are in the process of developing an index for the phenotype under investigation using a variety of descriptors so hopefully we will be able to use breedR in the future for this or other interesting traits.

Thank you,

Gabriele

